cs\">PvP Basics</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rainbow_Drops\" title=\"Rainbow Drops\">Rainbow Drops</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Reflection_-_Melee_and_Ranged\" title=\"Reflection - Melee and Ranged\">Reflection - Melee and Ranged</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rounding_Errors\" title=\"Rounding Errors\">Rounding Errors</a></li></ul>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shrinkage\" title=\"Shrinkage\">Shrinkage</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\">Stunning</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
